{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cubetory</strong> is a factory-building game with a deep focus on automation. You'll place mining drills, conveyor belts, launchers, stampers, power stations, and tons of other machines as you build your factory. Unlock new technologies and fully leverage them to work through the 16 levels of progression.  With no enemies or time limits, you\u2019ll have all the time you need to perfect your design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/banner_gif_1.gif?t=1743168498\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Paint-based manufacturing with the P.I.T.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to produce specific types of cubes by mining, painting, and assembling them, then delivering those cubes to the <strong>PIT</strong>.\u00a0 You'll never have to remove old supply lines\u00a0\u2014 only upgrade them\u00a0\u2014 as your factory will need to produce every type of Supply Cube to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/banner_gif_2.gif?t=1743168498\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Supply lines and Rate of Production</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each new tier of technology is unlocked by reaching a target rate of production, perfect for people who love tweaking their factory to run just right. New tiers introduce advanced technologies, more room to build, and new types of cubes you'll need to deliver to the <strong>PIT</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3027060?t=1743168498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/c9c0cf8e4cab44998f34a7ff2819e4db0a0d0bb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743168498","capsule_im